Subject: [PATCH] OPSP: Q2 FY27 critical numbers - live Inventory Fill Rate +
 IDC GP%, wire Foundation doc

- Inventory Fill Rate: Current and bands pulled live from Fill Rate Report - FY27
  (TOTAL FILL RATE tab); weekly trend card with category and SKU-band breakdown.
- Increase GAF IDC GP% to >42%: Current = selected quarter's average of daily
  fulfilled gross margin (GAF DATA col F, already-published sales feed).
- Foundation doc (persistent critical numbers) is now actually read, with built-in
  defaults so IDC GP% / Gym Designs can never silently disappear again; same-metric
  rows in quarter docs are de-duplicated.
- Doc proxy fetch extracted into a shared helper.
